WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:10.080
Part thirteen: approve stand logs. Check each time sheet against the sign-in sheet, fix any time that's off, and send it into the hours database.

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:14.643
On the admin home, Hub tools shows how many stands are waiting.

00:00:14.843 --> 00:00:17.180
Tap Approve stand logs.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:23.151
Each submitted stand, with who sent it, and the sign-in sheet photo. Open the photo.

00:00:23.351 --> 00:00:28.109
Check each line against the sheet: the times, the hours, and who the hours count for.

00:00:28.309 --> 00:00:34.411
Seventeen and a half hours? The stand lead picked A M instead of P M. Fix it with Adjust times.

00:00:34.611 --> 00:00:40.478
A flagged line, here someone who clocked in 40 minutes early, needs a reason before it can go in.

00:00:40.678 --> 00:00:45.620
A no-show isn't added to the database. It goes to No-show decisions.

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:47.943
Tap Adjust times.

00:00:48.143 --> 00:00:54.245
It shows what the stand lead sent. Those times are kept on the Stand Log; your fix goes next to them.

00:00:54.445 --> 00:00:58.520
Change the time to what the sign-in sheet shows. Here, four P M.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:02.198
Pick a reason. Matched to sign-in photo is the usual one.

00:01:02.398 --> 00:01:04.520
Tap Save adjustment.

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.659
Saved. The message shows the lead's times, your fix, and the new hours.

00:01:09.859 --> 00:01:12.953
Jordan's line now reads five and a half hours.

00:01:13.153 --> 00:01:17.569
In blue: what the lead sent, what it was changed to, why, and who changed it.

00:01:17.769 --> 00:01:22.847
Change adjustment lets you fix it again, or undo it and go back to the lead's times.

00:01:23.047 --> 00:01:29.480
The flags came from the lead's times. Your adjustment is the reason, so there's nothing more to type.

00:01:30.330 --> 00:01:34.683
Type why any other flag is OK. It's saved as the approval reason.

00:01:34.883 --> 00:01:38.840
Tap Approve the checked lines, then tap again to send them.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:49.547
Done. The hours are in the database, approved with your initials, with the lead's times and your adjustment both on file. The no-show went to No-show decisions.

00:01:49.747 --> 00:01:58.330
Anything you didn't approve stays here for later, like a line that names two students. Fix those on the Stand Log in the spreadsheet.
